{"doc_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:351907", "version_id": "sha256:4171753e2e5459504d86fb89b6ea4bec5374f19f4f0d10809bc779a946cee2d3", "chunk_id": "block-0007", "root_unit_id": "block-0007", "unit_type": "article_body", "text": "3. 为避免名额浪费，若其中一个专业推免名额没用完，剩余名额原则上调剂到另外一个专业。", "raw_text": "3. 为避免名额浪费，若其中一个专业推免名额没用完，剩余名额原则上调剂到另外一个专业。", "clean_text": "3. 为避免名额浪费，若其中一个专业推免名额没用完，剩余名额原则上调剂到另外一个专业。", "anchor": {"block_order": 7, "block_role": "paragraph", "parent_heading_path": [], "source_uri": "campusnotice://muc_internal_portal/notice/351907", "link_target": null}, "metadata": {"block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null}}
