{"doc_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:351907", "version_id": "sha256:4171753e2e5459504d86fb89b6ea4bec5374f19f4f0d10809bc779a946cee2d3", "chunk_id": "block-0009", "root_unit_id": "block-0009", "unit_type": "article_body", "text": "二、遴选推荐标准", "raw_text": "二、遴选推荐标准", "clean_text": "二、遴选推荐标准", "anchor": {"block_order": 9, "block_role": "paragraph", "parent_heading_path": [], "source_uri": "campusnotice://muc_internal_portal/notice/351907", "link_target": null}, "metadata": {"block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null}}
{"doc_id": "notice:muc_internal_portal:351907", "version_id": "sha256:4171753e2e5459504d86fb89b6ea4bec5374f19f4f0d10809bc779a946cee2d3", "chunk_id": "block-0010", "root_unit_id": "block-0010", "unit_type": "article_body", "text": "严格按照《中央民族大学2026届推荐应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生实施办法》的具体规定与要求进行推荐。", "raw_text": "严格按照《中央民族大学2026届推荐应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生实施办法》的具体规定与要求进行推荐。", "clean_text": "严格按照《中央民族大学2026届推荐应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士学位研究生实施办法》的具体规定与要求进行推荐。", "anchor": {"block_order": 10, "block_role": "paragraph", "parent_heading_path": [], "source_uri": "campusnotice://muc_internal_portal/notice/351907", "link_target": null}, "metadata": {"block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null}}
